From: Alexis <alexis.gre74@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:09:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Reposition site for Machine Learning Engineer roles

- New hero, meta tags and page title
- Rewrite ATLAS project with benchmark figures
- Add Experience section, remove unused PhD-oriented sections
- Update skills, contact, footer and README
- Fix broken navigation anchors, compress profile photo
